zations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-22T18:54:35Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T18:54:35Z","body":"You can upload a video but it won't help much without knowing what goes wrong, a video can only say so much, and the important part is not to show it happens but what might cause it, so a video indicating some idea of that would possibly help, but in the end being able to know how to make this happen is absolutely required (otherwise we can't really solve it, we need to know that it's solved and not just not happening right now)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2608024609/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2608393871","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101921#issuecomment-2608393871","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101921","id":2608393871,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6beO6P","user":{"login":"Jestus","id":5807295,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MDcyOTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5807295?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jestus","html_url":"https://github.com/Jestus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jestus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jestus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jestus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jestus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jestus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jestus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jestus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jestus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jestus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-22T22:24:13Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T22:24:13Z","body":"I have narrowed it down further - \n\nI have this class which in-scene is just a Node2D with child AudioStreamPlayer2D\n```\nextends Node2D\nclass_name ConfigurableSound\n\n@export var destroy_on_finish: bool = true\n@export var vary_pitch: bool = true\n@export var volume_db: float = 0\n\n@onready var audio_stream_player: AudioStreamPlayer2D = $AudioStreamPlayer2D\n\n# Called when the node enters the scene tree for the first time.\nfunc _ready():\n\tif destroy_on_finish:\n\t\taudio_stream_player.finished.connect(_on_audio_stream_player_2d_finished)\n\nfunc set_distance(distance: float):\n\taudio_stream_player.max_distance = distance\n\nfunc play(stream: AudioStream):\n\taudio_stream_player.stream = stream\n\taudio_stream_player.volume_db = volume_db\n\tif vary_pitch:\n\t\taudio_stream_player.pitch_scale = randf_range(0.75, 1.0) # to slightly vary the effect\n\t\n\taudio_stream_player.play()\n\nfunc _on_audio_stream_player_2d_finished():\n\tget_parent().remove_child(self)\n\tqueue_free()\n```\n\nI instantiate this like this:\n```\nfunc _on_pistol_shoot_ready():\n\tvar proficiency_modified_target = Helpers.get_ranged_weapon_proficiency_modified_shot_location(\n\t\tattack_target,\n\t\tactor_equipment.equipped_weapon,\n\t\tactor_stats,\n\t\tglobal_position)\n\tfire_shot(proficiency_modified_target)\n\t\n\t#var new_configurable_sound: ConfigurableSound = configurable_sound_scene.instantiate()\n\t#sound_holder.add_child(new_configurable_sound)\n\t#new_configurable_sound.play(actor_equipment.equipped_weapon.weapon_sound)\n\t\n\tactor_sprite.animate(Enums.AnimType.PISTOL_SHOOT_UNREADY, facing_direction)\n\tbroadcast_equipment_anim(Enums.AnimType.PISTOL_SHOOT_UNREADY)\n```\n\ncommenting the above shown lines got rid of the issue\n\nis there anything in these lines that stands out as problematic?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2608393871/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2608591705","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101921#issuecomment-2608591705","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101921","id":2608591705,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6be_NZ","user":{"login":"Jestus","id":5807295,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MDcyOTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5807295?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jestus","html_url":"https://github.com/Jestus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jestus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jestus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jestus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jestus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jestus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jestus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jestus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jestus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jestus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-23T00:41:21Z","updated_at":"2025-01-23T00:41:21Z","body":"I'm thinking it's this - going to run on 4.4 to see if it resolves:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/91123","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"rea